んが壁を背に座っている\n・海野さんが少し動揺した表情で、綺羅星さんが誘っているような表情\n・海野さんはタバコを吸っている（もしくは手にタバコ持っている）\n※タバコの銘柄は「マールボロ・アイス・ブラスト・メガ・8」です\n\n希望としては、\n出来る限り扇情的な一枚であってほしい（キスはしていないけど恋人関係と見える距離感）\n綺羅星さんの胸の大きさが伝わると嬉しいです。", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 852565, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぐじゃ太🍼", "screen_name": "NrU6c", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1611751118153093120/vq6gsoGB.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/775633948697202688/1680187723/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 100, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 1736895, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "Jona", "screen_name": "Yonagi_White", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1579092255386005504/fmMH80-p.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/738652963757903872/1713340515/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 1909740, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "今井", "screen_name": "Moro_sorano", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1898324326417666048/U3EiheTd.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2989834956/1728739039/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 20, "complete_